                  <nc xml:id="m-cbc9df7d-515a-43d6-b68c-3d84adaa45e1" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-1910ee9c-8244-451c-b596-0b6d08c8ef99" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-2e194ddd-cba0-42a4-9cd0-c78578e40cd5">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-5f9e4b60-fba3-4f5a-9628-0e9416a19d75" type="punctum" xml:id="m-925a20dd-276f-4989-a8f7-1c3cf932c381">
                  <nc xml:id="m-b9a9cdea-60ef-40dc-bda8-e825922211c6" pname="a" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-48bc4031-be9c-4549-9ec2-61accafbd34b" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-8839a20e-23a2-4648-8401-8f5d313fde5b" facs="#m-c8bae925-cc80-41c5-910c-22073986337c" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c82f3518-9924-46e8-afbf-21fa5ec0abd6">
            <lg xml:id="m-497212a9-e47a-4007-a311-445130eb80dc">
              <l xml:id="m-fa07bbd3-f9a1-4e1d-b175-f518ec6955b4" facs="#m-ac2e136d-8166-43d2-a684-0272d6a8e021" label="ambiguous">1344</l><l xml:id="m-f195249c-59b7-4bee-9849-e459fb19da9a" facs="#m-8ca8229a-9e37-4585-896c-db28138c729b" label="ambiguous">January 25.</l><l xml:id="m-300a567e-1d7a-4432-bb76-41e78d255fe7" facs="#m-b796dd1f-38ae-4bf9-98a4-8b8ef8752c1b" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-52828592-a4d1-4715-bebf-992e7ea5e72e" facs="#m-d8d04f4b-dca1-4ab5-b3a0-8376a384a9d9" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Libénter gloriábor. p. 1348. Chapter of Vespers. Saulus adhuc¬</l><l xml:id="m-f70b8807-45e5-4b9f-b6ea-106dac2581ef" facs="#m-a22c52f5-da15-4b8f-aa7f-d183c3f241dc" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. In ómnem térram. D. 1113. V. Constitues.</l><l xml:id="m-6622b603-6e33-422b-8fa5-af802ce51946" facs="#m-308b9ec1-675f-4cfc-b795-b1ca4316ad58" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-950e281b-ad1d-4f66-9b60-cbeef0cfc22c" facs="#m-d12b45b9-24be-47bb-a7d1-3ebf780d3b29" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-6d826cef-1ce9-4a3a-b2aa-26006d21f94a" facs="#m-d5aa75f0-941c-4b50-bdc0-9aca6b1219cb" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-c0520d31-f36e-4025-a8a4-f5b18b0ee3a6" facs="#m-a1c32db7-ec40-4458-8c1f-05c0bb0d7ef7" label="lyrics-like">cú-i cré-di-di,</l><l xml:id="m-cbd3cdfc-e8e9-467e-a8f7-2d89af4f4567" facs="#m-538c00ba-9335-4ac3-9727-0fcada46a392" label="lyrics-like">et cértus sum,</l><l xml:id="m-bf76bfd3-c21a-430c-98ab-bec3747f2548" facs="#m-bd921a01-8fbd-4836-88bc-b09a35a8d8ae" label="lyrics-like">qui-a pót-ens est</l><l xml:id="m-05ce6a6d-a994-4fbe-a27d-dea741165b44" facs="#m-98446ed4-047b-4bc2-b8ed-6661450f06ca" label="lyrics-like">depó-si-tum mé-um servá¬ re</l><l xml:id="m-833dc354-a7e3-4d98-bb19-9f4a876047c7" facs="#m-7d3638d0-0ed1-4bb1-bcd3-129db16d4a5c" label="lyrics-like">illum dí- em. Ps. Dómine probásti me, et co¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b928d15-f3cb-4d12-b93e-906db45d13f1" facs="#m-6e429ede-414a-4a3f-9d12-283ea24e095b" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-4af03998-cbf2-478d-b7de-2295040fa3be" facs="#m-e96440c3-3374-44da-95ec-5258868c4fa2" label="lyrics-like">gnovísti me:“ tu cognovísti sessi-ónem mé-am, et resur¬</l><l xml:id="m-4433c03a-200d-42e8-8fa8-af5927dc9314" facs="#m-bbb6b82d-ee39-439b-8dc0-928084a86a0a" label="lyrics-like">recti- ônem mé-am. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e</l><l xml:id="m-b3f59347-fb50-4acb-9ba3-8c69bd1f5434" facs="#m-59276d00-4247-445c-af1b-9d9a782ed78e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7538a7c1-73d4-4f98-918a-49461c2ce063" facs="#m-65d5d1d7-3f98-484c-bd14-d61dd6978344" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui univérsum mundum! mus; ut, qui ejus hódie Conver¬</l><l xml:id="m-da4b09cd-ff89-4eb6-b7d1-3c9724d4d368" facs="#m-826a4a5d-c5d8-4e73-84fe-7e903448699e" label="lyrics-like">I beáti Pauli Apóstoli praedica-siónem cólimus,“per ejus ad te</l><l xml:id="m-75fedff2-0885-41d6-bc42-b77213fbf8c9" facs="#m-481f2a4e-0509-4b22-8d3e-d74bcffd2f87" label="lyrics-like">tióne docuisti : t da nobis, quaésu-exémpla gradiámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ee03bad5-0d2e-43a9-b50a-1bbac3f17bc7" facs="#m-e04af2cc-2278-49bb-94bb-bc3396609b70" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of S. Peter. Collect. Deus qui beáto Petro. p. 1331.</l><l xml:id="m-0c78fc53-7786-423d-9663-d97836f036c2" facs="#m-be48d77a-8555-4ab2-af55-827c8d487e8d" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-4be64e94-eab9-4772-b522-8f86a5f0a497" facs="#m-dcf6f929-e269-4b8b-9594-c0c8a44ccd5c" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Saulus adhuc spi-Jesus, quem tu perséqueris. Durum</l><l xml:id="m-eb5de96d-a726-4276-bf6e-95b0a07cbb05" facs="#m-f595231c-4cb6-40c6-9aa5-a594943d1f2f" label="lyrics-like">L rans minárum et caedis in disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-4900d82c-4a91-4487-bbff-fa0c83f54944" facs="#m-5b9f6530-0310-44d9-817c-2520c2632607" label="lyrics-like">est tibi contra stimulum calcitráre.</l><l xml:id="m-a51b4eda-192d-4b80-a3de-daf8e51c718a" facs="#m-bd22c119-3012-4f40-82c1-9ea5848d6924" label="lyrics-like">pulos Dómini, accéssit ad principem</l><l xml:id="m-cacc9559-8edd-439a-b2a9-d568e9be21ce" facs="#m-437f2e8b-185b-43a8-847f-63dcb9fc0535" label="lyrics-like">Et tremens ac stupens, dixit: Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3543b6ab-b6ac-4071-af15-e771f333e11b" facs="#m-19d70d3b-0e4e-4959-8f62-b83d95c6d853" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótum, et pétiit ab eo episto¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6843724-8505-4ed4-aa82-8dac4af7af8d" facs="#m-0db112bf-ab4a-47e0-bd3b-b28788767341" label="lyrics-like">mine, quid me vis fácere? Et Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-73fff93e-5a53-4838-bbcc-4a4bd00f467c" facs="#m-dba5daf1-66db-4be9-b8f7-9019f8e2b9d4" label="lyrics-like">nus ad eum: Surge, et ingrédere</l><l xml:id="m-6c3aec29-02ff-4c8d-bb87-b7d15e2ac262" facs="#m-a7272b57-e0f0-45ef-b154-84e43255efbe" label="lyrics-like">las in Damáscum ad synagógas, ut</l><l xml:id="m-005b5302-aeef-4f79-aa66-aba75ca6ad74" facs="#m-b3168226-39b0-4c20-8edb-3bc36103a761" label="lyrics-like">civitátem, et ibi dicétur tibi quid te</l><l xml:id="m-169f4114-f425-405c-a98d-c78715c703c5" facs="#m-f48a19e5-8934-4f68-a11d-ef02f83aa776" label="lyrics-like">si quos invenísset hujus viae viros</l><l xml:id="m-e6c2fada-c953-419a-a55c-9a8b1d3b320e" facs="#m-998358ec-2236-477f-a04b-9bac1af3e036" label="lyrics-like">opórteat fácere. Viri autem illi,</l><l xml:id="m-0d48a5a6-ac36-40ba-80df-db0de27ccdd2" facs="#m-eec5b9ce-d868-47fa-9147-5f43990d35f7" label="lyrics-like">ac mulieres, vinctos perdúceret in</l><l xml:id="m-47f23716-4ba9-479d-b911-ec644dd9c05a" facs="#m-28122933-0aae-49b4-ae79-e17bb8c90e0f" label="lyrics-like">qui comitabántur cum eo, stabant</l><l xml:id="m-c4729af2-a5c7-4467-a403-a50a333e24f1" facs="#m-16a5e4fc-7a5b-4371-ae54-c1049b3dd9f0" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem. Et cum iter fáceret cón¬</l><l xml:id="m-5349a08b-7f9c-4e33-ac06-614c2367cfe3" facs="#m-b4f53cd9-7cd1-49bf-9c8b-e6e2b10c3fcd" label="lyrics-like">tigit ut appropinquáret Damásco:</l><l xml:id="m-1c501b74-1efe-493e-94f1-5bc06c8c577e" facs="#m-3eb1bb99-c706-43b4-bf18-7df50173d128" label="lyrics-like">stupefácti, audiéntes quidem vocem,</l><l xml:id="m-c6ef2c47-7c74-4021-a5cf-6b7b9485cde7" facs="#m-8a88bc28-930c-453b-8ffa-8ce985b75c72" label="lyrics-like">et súbito circumfulsit eum lux de</l><l xml:id="m-27678cb8-e65e-4313-bcad-a8bf5be3db6e" facs="#m-12032741-0985-4a8e-ace0-3cc5d74d8905" label="lyrics-like">néminem autem vidéntes. Surréxit</l><l xml:id="m-692f0c8c-df9a-44bf-8f85-e4ac984ff59f" facs="#m-9c7a894d-9977-458c-9b09-8589a9458fdd" label="ambiguous">autem Saulus de terra, apertisque</l><l xml:id="m-164d126e-a3f0-4205-8dbb-9d661114d949" facs="#m-4d412adf-f9d5-4768-bc3a-f34ace6e87c6" label="ambiguous">caelo. Et cadens in terram, audivit</l><l xml:id="m-04a8763b-cbf3-4219-aaa1-ce867374005d" facs="#m-b11426ac-c973-4424-b6b0-0625e4ab79c1" label="lyrics-like">vocem dicéntem sibi : Saule, Saule,</l><l xml:id="m-f321259b-6f2d-4165-90c7-9bb51b40499c" facs="#m-4006f943-61ca-4610-b9dd-61b1313e53f7" label="lyrics-like">óculis nihil vidébat. Ad manus au¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a99666b-dd38-450e-9f1a-9a503f1486cb" facs="#m-559db833-e0c6-4234-bdc4-e9dae0daaa7f" label="lyrics-like">quid me perséqueris? Qui dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-a835b197-b479-4475-82b7-526f7f6bb872" facs="#m-04507606-97c9-4e42-bd38-902f36df69fe" label="lyrics-like">tem illum trahéntes, introduxérunt</l><l xml:id="m-3cd0763f-dacd-4c8e-afa5-9f895c960171" facs="#m-5c516687-bb01-49e8-9e9b-448f47d3ced4" label="lyrics-like">Quis es, Dómine? Et ille: Ego sum! Damáscum. Et erat ibi tribus diébus</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>